description	"Czerka Tech Expert

Mega-Corp Tech Experts and Slicers tasked with defending their property, alive or otherwise...

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
- Pulse Pistol (1)
-- Clone Pistol, Pulse On Hit
-- 50%- Damage, 25%- RoF, 100%+ FP Drain
- Ion Spread Blaster (Shotgun 3)
-- Pulse On Hit
-- 65%- FP Drain, 60%- Damage, 15%+ RoF
- Terminal Slicer Kit (Stun Baton 1)
-- 75%- Damage, 80%+ RoF, Pulses/Ignites
- Detpacks (2)
- Pulse Grenades (2)

^8Attributes:
- Reinforcement (1)
- Stamina (3)
- Assemble (2)
- EWEB Emplacement Gun ^3[CS2]
- Remote Seeker Drone
- Sentry Gun
- Personal Shield
- 45% Faster Hack Speed
- Large Medpack
- Anti Mind Trick (1)
- Elemental Protection (1)

^3Abilities:
- Sprint ^3[CS1]
- Quickthrow ^3[CS2]
- Enemy Scanner ^3[CS4]"